130844" :question/id #uuid "38c97562-ceac-5118-b790-c3b892a56a1e" :question/math-academy-id "q-130844" :question/problem "Let $E=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].$ Find the row operation that, when applied to a $2\\times 2$ matrix $A,$ gives the result of the product $EA.$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $E$ is obtained by taking the first row of the identity matrix and adding $8$ times the second row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $EA$ is equivalent to applying the row operation ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2}$ to $A.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130844/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f0f47800-98b3-512e-af20-1899e6b0c86d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130844"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130838/selection/ee7d0585d9a8d6e74d8bd1888ec7c61bbac7dcb1fb3811aa4c1cbf582fec5f70" :answer/id #uuid "95c0daf0-5855-5be4-bc60-e829b6b6ef61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{1}+5{R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130838/selection/08f39c8cc0b350c5947e3ccf5985dcc5d7e23e019ebbc72b682868fe1cd156fe" :answer/id #uuid "e1005add-fabb-5f0a-ac68-14bd4d203cac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-5){R}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130838/selection/fa64e7c567b997e108c5ce435841dc0d64d009fe825333c103304bc6362ca36d" :answer/id #uuid "056ef133-5828-5d46-bcfa-f500220c80c0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:={R}_{1}+(-5){R}_{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130838/selection/1845d7be6052605dbff51a362e8416b4e2ee3cac12b308701cafb666bc6278fd" :answer/id #uuid "ace3e252-598c-5764-b4de-1cf96054b120" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}_{2}:=-5{R}_{2}" :db/ensure